<h1>Toate textele</h1>

Aici ai lista textelor scrise de mine pe acest site. 

Când scriu ceva nou, afli instant dacă ești abonat prin email:

<form class="newsletter-form" action="/.netlify/functions/subscribe" method="post" novalidate>
  <div class="input-group">
    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Adresa ta de email" required aria-label="Adresa de email" autocomplete="email" />
    <button type="submit">Abonare</button>
  </div>
  <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;" />
  <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAFyVYQ2v1LRPUcTK" data-size="flexible" data-language="ro"></div>
  <p class="form-message" aria-live="polite"></p>
</form>


